  "title": "Easy Vegan Sheet Pan Roasted Cauliflower, Tomatoes, and Garbanzo Beans",
  "description": "Roasted cauliflower, garbanzo beans, tomatoes, lime wedges, and cilantro make a delicious, quick-and-easy, one-pan vegan dinner for two.",
